sequenceDiagram
  participant Owner
  participant SA as Super admin
  participant Web as Web app
  participant API as API and SubscriptionGuard
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  Owner->>Web: Open any page during the trial
  Web->>API: GET /account
  API-->>Web: status trialing, banner Free trial N days left
  Note over Owner,PG: Trial end passes. 3 grace days follow. Writes still work and a banner warns everyone
  Owner->>Web: Save something in the grace period
  Web->>API: any write request
  API-->>Web: accepted
  Note over Owner,PG: Trial end plus 3 days passes. Status is expired
  Owner->>Web: Save something
  Web->>API: any write request
  API-->>Web: 402 SUBSCRIPTION_EXPIRED, reads still work
  Owner->>SA: Pays outside the Platform and sends the reference
  SA->>Web: Subscriptions, Manage subscription, Record payment
  Web->>API: POST /admin/subscriptions/:orgId/payments
  API->>PG: lock organization, payment row, paid_until, plan, audit
  API->>API: clear the read-only cache of this process
  Owner->>Web: Save again
  Web->>API: any write request
  API-->>Web: accepted, other processes may take up to 30 seconds
